<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Roadwings Western Pvt. Ltd. — Logistics & Transport</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#10151C;
    --panel:#1C232D;
    --panel-2:#222B36;
    --accent:#E8A33D;
    --text:#EDEAE2;
    --text-dim:#9CA3AE;
    --line:#2C3543;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.eyebrow,.logo{
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;}

  /* ---- Header ---- */
  header{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:flex-start;
    align-items:center;
    padding:28px 6vw;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .logo-block{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:6px;
  }
  .logo{
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:1.6rem;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .header-contact{
    font-size:0.78rem;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  .logo span{color:var(--accent);}
  nav a{
    margin-left:32px;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    transition:color .2s;
  }
  nav a:hover{color:var(--text);}

  /* ---- Hero ---- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    padding:120px 6vw 100px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    color:var(--accent);
    font-size:0.8rem;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    font-weight:600;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    display:block;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem);
    line-height:1.05;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    max-width:14ch;
  }
  .hero p{
    margin-top:24px;
    max-width:46ch;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    font-size:1.05rem;
    line-height:1.6;
  }

  /* route line signature */
  .route{
    position:relative;
    margin-top:64px;
    height:2px;
    background:var(--line);
    width:100%;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .route::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:0; left:0;
    height:2px;
    width:200%;
    background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(
      to right,
      var(--accent) 0px,
      var(--accent) 36px,
      transparent 36px,
      transparent 64px
    );
    animation:drive 3.2s linear infinite;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .route::before{animation:none;}
  }
  @keyframes drive{
    from{transform:translateX(0);}
    to{transform:translateX(-100px);}
  }
  .route-label{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    margin-top:10px;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    letter-spacing:0.1em;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }

  /* ---- Services ---- */
  .services{
    padding:90px 6vw 100px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .section-head{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:baseline;
    margin-bottom:48px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px;
  }
  .section-head h2{
    font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.4vw,2.4rem);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .section-head .eyebrow{margin-bottom:0;}
  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--line);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .card{
    background:var(--panel);
    padding:36px 30px;
    transition:background .25s;
  }
  .card:hover{background:var(--panel-2);}
  .card h3{
    font-size:1.05rem;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    margin-bottom:14px;
    color:var(--accent);
  }
  .card p{
    color:var(--text-dim);
    font-size:0.92rem;
    line-height:1.6;
  }

  /* ---- Fleet / Equipment ---- */
  .fleet{
    padding:0 6vw 100px;
  }
  .fleet-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:28px;
  }
  .fleet-card{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .fleet-photo{
    aspect-ratio:16/10;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, var(--panel-2) 0 2px, transparent 2px 14px),
      var(--panel);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
  }
  .fleet-placeholder{
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    text-align:center;
    line-height:1.5;
    border:1px dashed var(--line);
    padding:14px 22px;
  }
  .fleet-card h3{
    font-size:1.05rem;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    color:var(--accent);
    padding:24px 26px 0;
  }
  .fleet-card p{
    color:var(--text-dim);
    font-size:0.92rem;
    line-height:1.6;
    padding:12px 26px 26px;
  }

  /* ---- Contact / Footer ---- */
  footer{
    padding:80px 6vw 50px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .contact-grid{
    display:block;
  }
  footer h2{
    font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.4vw,2.3rem);
    font-weight:600;
    max-width:16ch;
    line-height:1.15;
  }
  .contact-list{
    margin-top:36px;
  }
  .contact-row{
    padding:18px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:4px;
  }
  .contact-row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .contact-row .label{
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--text-dim);
  }
  .contact-row .value{
    font-size:1.05rem;
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .contact-row .value a:hover{color:var(--accent);}
  .foot-note{
    margin-top:60px;
    font-size:0.8rem;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
  }

  /* ---- Minimal Footer ---- */
  .minimal-foot{
    padding:30px 6vw 40px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:0.8rem;
    color:var(--text-dim);
  }

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .fleet-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    nav a{margin-left:18px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){
    header{padding:22px 5vw;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;}
    nav a{margin-left:0;margin-right:18px;}
    .header-contact{white-space:normal;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo-block">
    <div class="logo">ROADWINGS WESTERN <span>PVT LTD</span></div>
    <div class="header-contact">201, 2nd Floor, Jai Antriksh, Off Andheri Marol Road, Mumbai – 400 059<br>email@roadwingswestern.com &nbsp;·&nbsp; +91 93225 92659 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +91 81041 43209</div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <span class="eyebrow">Container Handling &amp; Transportation — Mumbai</span>
  <h1>Containers,<br>moved on schedule.</h1>
  <p>Roadwings Western Pvt. Ltd. handles and transports containers across Western India — from port to yard to final destination, on dependable fleets and routes that run on time.</p>

  <div class="route"></div>
  <div class="route-label">
    <span>Port</span>
    <span>Yard</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">What We Do</span>
      <h2>Services</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Container Transportation</h3>
      <p>Full container load (FCL) movement by road across Maharashtra and Western India, from port terminals to inland destinations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Container Handling</h3>
      <p>Loading, unloading, and yard handling of containers, managed with trained crews and the right equipment for safe turnaround.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Port &amp; CFS Linkages</h3>
      <p>Reliable connectivity between ports, container freight stations, and customer locations, tracked from pickup to delivery.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Cargo Handling</h3>
      <p>Careful loading, unloading, and movement of cargo within containers, handled with trained crews and proper equipment.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fleet" id="fleet">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Equipment</span>
      <h2>Fleet &amp; Yard Equipment</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="fleet-grid">
    <div class="fleet-card">
      <div class="fleet-photo" style="background:none;padding:0;"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Reach Stacker" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"></div>
      <h3>Reach Stackers</h3>
      <p>Used for stacking, lifting, and moving containers within the yard with precision and speed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fleet-card">
      <div class="fleet-photo" style="background:none;padding:0;"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Trailer" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"></div>
      <h3>Trailers</h3>
      <p>Multi-axle trailers built to carry 20, 40, and 45-foot containers safely across long-haul routes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer id="contact">
  <div class="contact-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Get In Touch</span>
      <h2>Let's move your shipment forward.</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot-note">
    <span>© 2026 Roadwings Western Pvt. Ltd.</span>
    <span>Mumbai, India</span>
  </div>
</footer>




</body>
</html>
